{"id":5017,"date":"2024-12-06T14:01:10","date_gmt":"2024-12-06T06:01:10","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?p=5017"},"modified":"2024-12-06T17:05:00","modified_gmt":"2024-12-06T09:05:00","slug":"industrial-filter-bags","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?p=5017","title":{"rendered":"Industrial Filter Bags"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"5017\" class=\"elementor elementor-5017\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0816874 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"0816874\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-05108e3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"05108e3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Philite\u00ae offers various types of industrial filter bags and solutions for liquid or dust filtration.<\/p><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">01. Industrial Dust Filter Bags<\/h2><p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-5022 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Industrial-Dust-Filter-Bags-800x450-p1_syy.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Industrial-Dust-Filter-Bags-800x450-p1_syy.jpeg 800w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Industrial-Dust-Filter-Bags-800x450-p1_syy-300x169.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Industrial-Dust-Filter-Bags-800x450-p1_syy-768x432.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Industrial-Dust-Filter-Bags-800x450-p1_syy-600x338.jpeg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><\/p><p>Industrial dust filter bags are devices used to capture dust and solid particles generated in industrial production. These filter bags are often called bag filters or baghouses. They filter gas containing dust particles through a series of fabric bags, trapping the solid particles inside the bags while allowing clean gas to pass through.<\/p><p>Industrial dust filter bags are typically made from high-performance filter materials such as polyester, polypropylene or fiberglass. These materials can effectively capture particles of different sizes and shapes, and are resistant to high temperatures and corrosion, making them suitable for various industrial environments.<\/p><p>These filter bags are widely used in fields such as coal combustion, cement production, metallurgical industry, chemical production, etc., and play an important role in dust removal and environmental protection in industrial production.<\/p><p class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Learn more about\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?page_id=2666\"><strong>Industrial Dust Filter Bags<\/strong><\/a>.<\/p><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">02. Industrial Liquid Filter Bags<\/h2><p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-5023 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Liquid-Filter-Bags-p2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1612\" height=\"503\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Liquid-Filter-Bags-p2.jpg 1612w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Liquid-Filter-Bags-p2-300x94.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Liquid-Filter-Bags-p2-1024x320.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Liquid-Filter-Bags-p2-768x240.jpg 768w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Liquid-Filter-Bags-p2-1536x479.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Liquid-Filter-Bags-p2-1320x412.jpg 1320w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Liquid-Filter-Bags-p2-600x187.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1612px) 100vw, 1612px\" \/><\/p><p>Industrial liquid filter bags are devices used to filter solid particles or other impurities in industrial fluids. Similar to industrial dust filter bags, industrial liquid filter bags are also widely used in various industrial fields, including chemical, petrochemical, food and beverage, pharmaceutical, electronics, etc.<\/p><p>These filter bags are usually made from durable materials such as polyester, polypropylene, nylon or special fiberglass. Their design and material selection can be adjusted based on factors such as the nature of the liquid, temperature, pressure, and the size and shape of the particles that need to be filtered.<\/p><p>Industrial liquid filter bags work by passing fluid through the filter bag, trapping solid particles and impurities inside the bag while allowing clean liquid to pass through. This filtration method effectively improves the purity and cleanliness of industrial fluids, helps maintain the normal operation of equipment, and ensures product quality.<\/p><p class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Learn more about\u00a0<strong><a href=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?page_id=2697\">Industrial Liquid Filter Bags<\/a><\/strong>.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Philite\u00ae offers various types of industrial filter bags and solutions for liquid or dust filtration. 01. Industrial Dust Filter Bags [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":5022,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"site-sidebar-layout":"default","site-content-layout":"","ast-site-content-layout":"","site-content-style":"default","site-sidebar-style":"default","ast-global-header-display":"","ast-banner-title-visibility":"","ast-main-header-display":"","ast-hfb-above-header-display":"","ast-hfb-below-header-display":"","ast-hfb